{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792568340, "covers_from": "2026-10-21T07:39:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-21T07:40:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792568400, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-21T07:39:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 59266, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "交通", "content": "台北當初有102座天橋，現在剩下50座，曾經住在日本，天橋算是多人走後續都改成廊道，但在台北都用拆的", "display_name": "大同代表 Kuei", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-21T07:39:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 37674, "sprite_key": "beaver_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "台北好多舊公寓 真的很醜 如果都更很難 但至少可以把一些公寓外面拉皮吧", "display_name": "大安代表 No.37,674", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-21T07:39:26+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 39580, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "環境", "content": "台北市政府最近一直砍樹，能否協助偵辦砍樹的原因並啟動調查相關人員疏失，才能幫忙因此失去家的小動物究責", "display_name": "信義代表 No.39,580", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-21T07:39:41+00:00", "duration_seconds": 19, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 21632, "sprite_key": "beaver_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "台北市老舊公寓不僅有礙市容，安全其實也很有隱憂。歷任市長雖然都想推動都更，但似乎成效不彰，到底有沒有", "display_name": "信義代表 Sean Wu", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 37674, "sprite_key": "beaver_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.37,674", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 39580, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "display_name": "信義代表 No.39,580", "district": "xinyi", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 21632, "sprite_key": "beaver_business", "display_name": "信義代表 Sean Wu", "district": "xinyi", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 14119, "sprite_key": "penguin_culture", "displ